Derived work
------------

Parts of the calibration code draw on these GPL-3.0 projects, including the
ladder search and spindle settling in crates/disc-core/src/calib/ and values such
as the spiral grid size and the calibration volume label:

- disc-probe: https://github.com/Ashley-QwQ/disc-probe
- discprobe-macos: https://github.com/NaiveTomcat/discprobe-macos

The source code of Discratcher and of these changes is available at
https://github.com/POPCORNBOOM/Discratcher
